   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 1. LLM-as-judge 原理 —— 用强模型评估弱模型\n",
    "\n",
    "**Rule-based judge**：基于固定规则（如关键词匹配）\n",
    "- 优点：快速、确定\n",
    "- 缺点：不能理解语义，无法捕捉复杂模式\n",
    "\n",
    "**LLM-as-judge**：用更强模型（Claude/GPT-4/DeepSeek）评估目标模型\n",
    "- 优点：理解语义、可定制 rubric\n",
    "- 缺点：有偏见、成本高、慢\n",
    "\n",
    "**关键技巧**：\n",
    "- 给 rubric（评分标准）\n",
    "- CoT 先论据后打分（减少偏见）\n",
    "- 多次评同题求均值（降方差）\n",
    "- pairwise 比较（更稳）"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "id": "s1-c1",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# OFFLINE 模式：模拟 LLM-as-judge vs Rule-based judge\n",
    "\n",
    "class RuleBasedJudge:\n",
    "    def __init__(self, keywords):\n",
    "        self.keywords = keywords\n",
    "    \n",
    "    def score(self, prediction, ground_truth):\n",
    "        # 简单的关键词匹配\n",
    "        score = 0\n",
    "        for kw in self.keywords:\n",
    "            if kw in prediction and kw in ground_truth:\n",
    "                score += 1\n",
    "        return score / len(self.keywords)\n",
    "\n",
    "class LLMJudge:\n",
    "    def __init__(self):\n",
    "        self.model = 'deepseek-v3'  # 假设强模型\n",
    "    \n",
    "    def score_with_rubric(self, prediction, ground_truth, rubric):\n",
    "        # OFFLINE：模拟 CoT + 打分\n",
    "        # 实际：用 Claude/GPT-4 API\n",
    "        return 4.0  # 1-5 分\n",
    "\n",
    "# 测试\n",
    "judge_rb = RuleBasedJudge(['Transformer', '注意力'])\n",
    "judge_llm = LLMJudge()\n",
    "\n",
    "test_cases = [\n",
    "    {\n",
    "        'prediction': 'Transformer 是基于注意力的机制。',\n",
    "        'ground_truth': 'Transformer 是 2017 年 Google 提出的注意力机制架构。',\n",
    "        'keywords': ['Transformer', '注意力'],\n",
    "        'description': '部分匹配'\n",
    "    },\n",
    "    {\n",
    "        'prediction': 'Transformer 是 Google 2017 年提出的。',\n",
    "        'ground_truth': 'Transformer 是 2017 年 Google 提出的注意力机制架构。',\n",
    "        'keywords': ['Transformer', '注意力'],\n",
    "        'description': '缺少"注意力"'\n",
    "    }\n",
    "]\n",
    "\n",
    "print('=== Rule-based vs LLM-as-judge 对比 ===')\n",
    "for case in test_cases:\n",
    "    rb_score = judge_rb.score(case['prediction'], case['ground_truth'])\n",
    "    llm_score = judge_llm.score_with_rubric(case['prediction'], case['ground_truth'], rubric='相关性 1-5')\n",
    "    print(f'\\n[{case[\"description\"]}]')\n",
    "    print(f'  RB score: {rb_score:.2f}')\n",
    "    print(f'  LLM score: {llm_score:.2f}')"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "s2-md",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 2. RAGAS 5 指标详解\n",
    "\n",
    "**RAGAS（Retrieval-Augmented Generation Assessment）**是 RAG 评估主流框架。\n",
    "\n",
    "**5 个核心指标**：\n",
    "1. **faithfulness（忠实度）**：答案是否忠实于检索到的上下文（有没有捏造）\n",
    "2. **context_relevance（上下文相关性）**：检索到的上下文是否相关\n",
    "3. **answer_relevance（答案相关性）**：答案是否回答了问题\n",
    "4. **context_precision（上下文精确度）**：检索到的上下文中，哪些部分真正有用\n",
    "5. **answer_correctness（答案正确性）**：答案是否正确（需要 ground truth）\n",
    "\n",
    "**不需要 ground truth 的指标**：faithfulness / context_relevance / answer_relevance / context_precision\n",
    "**需要 ground truth 的指标**：answer_correctness"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "id": "s2-c1",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# OFFLINE 模式：模拟 RAGAS 5 指标计算\n",
    "\n",
    "def faithfulness_score(query, answer, contexts):\n",
    "    \"\"\"忠实度：答案是否被上下文完全支持\"\"\"\n",
    "    # 简化：检查答案是否被所有上下文共同覆盖\n",
    "    context_overlap = 0\n",
    "    for ctx in contexts:\n",
    "        if query in ctx or any(kw in answer for kw in ctx.split()[:3]):\n",
    "            context_overlap += 1\n",
    "    return context_overlap / len(contexts) if contexts else 0.0\n",
    "\n",
    "def context_relevance_score(query, contexts):\n",
    "    \"\"\"上下文相关性：检索到的上下文是否包含问题关键词\"\"\"\n",
    "    keywords = set(query.split())\n",
    "    relevant_count = sum(1 for ctx in contexts if any(kw in ctx for kw in keywords))\n",
    "    return relevant_count / len(contexts) if contexts else 0.0\n",
    "\n",
    "def answer_relevance_score(query, answer):\n",
    "    \"\"\"答案相关性：答案是否回答了问题（简单的文本重叠）\"\"\"\n",
    "    answer_tokens = set(answer.split())\n",
    "    query_tokens = set(query.split())\n",
    "    overlap = len(answer_tokens & query_tokens)\n",
    "    return overlap / len(query_tokens) if query_tokens else 0.0\n",
    "\n",
    "def context_precision_score(query, contexts, answer):\n",
    "    \"\"\"上下文精确度：上下文中哪些部分真正有用\"\"\"\n",
    "    # 简化：检查上下文是否包含答案中的关键词\n",
    "    answer_keywords = set(answer.split()[:10])\n",
    "    relevant_count = sum(1 for ctx in contexts if any(kw in ctx for kw in answer_keywords))\n",
    "    return relevant_count / len(contexts) if contexts else 0.0\n",
    "\n",
    "def answer_correctness_score(answer, ground_truth):\n",
    "    \"\"\"答案正确性：是否与 ground truth 匹配（这里用 F1）\"\"\"\n",
    "    pred_tokens = set(answer.split())\n",
    "    gt_tokens = set(ground_truth.split())\n",
    "    overlap = len(pred_tokens & gt_tokens)\n",
    "    precision = overlap / len(pred_tokens) if pred_tokens else 0\n",
    "    recall = overlap / len(gt_tokens) if gt_tokens else 0\n",
    "    return 2 * precision * recall / (precision + recall) if (precision + recall) > 0 else 0\n",
    "\n",
    "# 测试\n",
    "test_qa = {\n",
    "    'query': '什么是 Transformer？',\n",
    "    'answer': 'Transformer 是 2017 年 Google 提出的注意力机制架构。',\n",
    "    'contexts': [\n",
    "        'Transformer 是 Google 2017 年提出的新模型。',\n",
    "        'Transformer 基于注意力机制，可以处理长序列。',\n",
    "        '这是关于 Transformer 的详细解释。'\n",
    "    ],\n",
    "    'ground_truth': 'Transformer 是 2017 年 Google 提出的注意力机制架构。'\n",
    "}\n",
    "\n",
    "print('=== RAGAS 5 指标计算 ===')\n",
    "metrics = {\n",
    "    'faithfulness': faithfulness_score(test_qa['query'], test_qa['answer'], test_qa['contexts']),\n",
    "    'context_relevance': context_relevance_score(test_qa['query'], test_qa['contexts']),\n",
    "    'answer_relevance': answer_relevance_score(test_qa['query'], test_qa['answer']),\n",
    "    'context_precision': context_precision_score(test_qa['query'], test_qa['contexts'], test_qa['answer']),\n",
    "    'answer_correctness': answer_correctness_score(test_qa['answer'], test_qa['ground_truth'])\n",
    "}\n",
    "\n",
    "for name, score in metrics.items():\n",
    "    print(f'  {name:20s}: {score:.3f}')"
   ]
  },
