    "## 4. 评估 loop —— 读 eval set → 调 query 接口 → 算指标 → 输出表格\n",
    "\n",
    "评估 loop 的标准流程：\n",
    "1. 读 eval set（JSONL）\n",
    "2. 对每题：调用 RAG query 接口\n",
    "3. 算 EM / RAGAS 5 指标\n",
    "4. 输出 markdown 表格\n",
    "5. 记录 baseline（每次改动加一列）"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "id": "s4-c1",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# OFFLINE 模式：模拟评估 loop\n",
    "\n",
    "def simulate_rag_query(question):\n",
    "    # 模拟 RAG query 接口返回\n",
    "    if question.startswith('什么是 Transformer'):\n",
    "        return 'Transformer 是 2017 年 Google 提出的注意力机制架构。'\n",
    "    elif question.startswith('Python'):\n",
    "        return 'Python 3.12 的特性包括更快、更清晰的语法。'\n",
    "    elif question.startswith('HTTP 状态码'):\n",
    "        return '404 Not Found'\n",
    "    else:\n",
    "        return '不知道'\n",
    "\n",
    "# 对 eval set 的前 5 题做评估\n",
    "baseline_results = []\n",
    "for q in EVAL_SET[:5]:\n",
    "    prediction = simulate_rag_query(q['question'])\n",
    "    em = exact_match(prediction, q['answer'])\n",
    "    f1 = f1_score(prediction, q['answer'])\n",
    "    \n",
    "    baseline_results.append({\n",
    "        'id': q['id'],\n",
    "        'type': q['type'],\n",
    "        'difficulty': q['difficulty'],\n",
    "        'question': q['question'][:50] + '...',\n",
    "        'prediction': prediction[:50] + '...',\n",
    "        'ground_truth': q['answer'][:50] + '...',\n",
    "        'em': em,\n",
    "        'f1': round(f1, 3)\n",
    "    })\n",
    "\n",
    "# 输出 markdown 表格\n",
    "print('=== Baseline 评估结果（前 5 题）===')\n",
    "print('| ID | Type | Difficulty | Question | Prediction | Ground Truth | EM | F1 |')\n",
    "print('|----|------|------------|----------|------------|--------------|----|----|')\n",
    "for r in baseline_results:\n",
    "    print(f'| {r[\"id\"]:2d} | {r[\"type\"]:6s} | {r[\"difficulty\"]:9s} | {r[\"question\"]:20s} | {r[\"prediction\"]:20s} | {r[\"ground_truth\"]:20s} | {r[\"em\"]} | {r[\"f1\"]} |')"
   ]
