   "source": [
    "## 5. 分层评估策略 — — 不要只评端到端\n",
    "\n",
    "**分层评估**（Layered Evaluation）：逐层评估每个组件\n",
    "\n",
    "**评估层级**：\n",
    "1. **嵌入层**：MRR / Hit@k（评估 embedding 质量）\n",
    "2. **检索层**：Recall@k / Precision@k / NDCG@k（评估检索质量）\n",
    "3. **重排层**：NDCG@k（评估 reranker 质量）\n",
    "4. **生成层**：faithfulness / answer_correctness（评估生成质量）\n",
    "\n",
    "**混合评估策略**：\n",
    "- **离线 batch 评估**：完整 eval set，规则指标（EM / F1）\n",
    "- **在线 A/B 测试**：LLM-as-judge + 真实用户反馈\n",
    "- **实时监控**：Langfuse / SaaS 平台 + 快速 rejection 过滤"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "id": "s5-c1",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# OFFLINE 模式：模拟分层评估\n",
    "\n",
    "# 嵌入层评估\n",
    "def mrr_score(retrieved_docs, relevant_docs):\n",
    "    \"\"\"Mean Reciprocal Rank：第一个相关文档的倒数位置\"\"\"\n",
    "    for rank, doc_id in enumerate(retrieved_docs, start=1):\n",
    "        if doc_id in relevant_docs:\n",
    "            return 1.0 / rank\n",
    "    return 0.0\n",
    "\n",
    "# 检索层评估\n",
    "def precision_at_k(retrieved_docs, relevant_docs, k):\n",
    "    \"\"\"Precision@k：前 k 个中相关文档的比例\"\"\"\n",
    "    retrieved_at_k = retrieved_docs[:k]\n",
    "    relevant_count = sum(1 for doc_id in retrieved_at_k if doc_id in relevant_docs)\n",
    "    return relevant_count / k\n",
    "\n",
    "def ndcg_score(retrieved_docs, relevant_docs, k):\n",
    "    \"\"\"NDCG@k：归一化折损累计增益\"\"\"\n",
    "    retrieved_at_k = retrieved_docs[:k]\n",
    "    dcg = sum(1.0 / np.log2(i+2) for i, doc_id in enumerate(retrieved_at_k) if doc_id in relevant_docs)\n",
    "    # 理想情况：所有相关文档都在前 k\n",
    "    ideal_relevant = sum(1.0 / np.log2(i+2) for i in range(min(len(relevant_docs), k)))\n",
    "    return dcg / ideal_relevant if ideal_relevant > 0 else 0.0\n",
    "\n",
    "# 模拟检索结果\n",
    "test_retrieval = {\n",
    "    'query': '什么是 Transformer？',\n",
    "    'retrieved_docs': [0, 1, 5, 7],  # 检索到的文档 ID\n",
    "    'relevant_docs': [0, 1]  # 真实相关文档 ID\n",
    "}\n",
    "\n",
    "print('=== 分层评估指标 ===')\n",
    "print(f'嵌入层（MRR）: {mrr_score(test_retrieval[\"retrieved_docs\"], test_retrieval[\"relevant_docs\"]):.3f}')\n",
    "print(f'检索层（Precision@3）: {precision_at_k(test_retrieval[\"retrieved_docs\"], test_retrieval[\"relevant_docs\"], 3):.3f}')\n",
    "print(f'检索层（NDCG@3）: {ndcg_score(test_retrieval[\"retrieved_docs\"], test_retrieval[\"relevant_docs\"], 3):.3f}')\n",
    "\n",
    "print('\\n=== 混合评估策略 ===')\n",
    "print('离线 batch: 完整 eval set + 规则指标（EM/F1/RAGAS）')\n",
    "print('在线 A/B: LLM-as-judge + 真实用户反馈')\n",
    "print('实时监控: Langfuse + 快速 rejection')"
   ]
  },
